Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: Cannot write to `values` — it has read access only
  --> tests/ui/ownership/plain_parameter_write_take_and_escape_diagnostics_name_explicit_access.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     values[0] = 4
    |           ^^^
 Why: An unmarked parameter gives read access only; assigning into it needs write access
 Fix: Change the parameter to `values: &[Int]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
